- "snippet": A concise, one-sentence quote or summary that is most relevant to the source's title. If possible, extract this directly from the "Summary of Findings" text. If no specific sentence can be confidently attributed, provide a brief, plausible summary of what the source likely contains based on its title. The snippet should be no more than 150 characters.

Example response:
[
  { "uri": "https://example.com/report1", "snippet": "APT28 was observed using new variants of the Zebrocy malware in their recent campaigns." },
